{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p01", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 1, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p01.png", "width": 1600, "height": 1600, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [], "reading_order": [], "sha256": "123fcd04167dd5bc5cebbfb648f0364bd6eef1afb1edf56b717a57dbd5241e40"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p02", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 2, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p02.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [194, 61, 452, 28], "text": "夏天热，夏天长，夏天菜园菜成行。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [252, 108, 349, 28], "text": "“绿色的蔬菜，红色的蔬菜，", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [268, 154, 308, 29], "text": "黄色的蔬菜，我都爱！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [1052, 669, 324, 29], "text": "“快看，有个番茄在动！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 747, 1069, 33], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 夏 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 猜一猜，番茄为什么会动？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "95cbedf854d19cd4cbddccff374c4db409feaefb3c2f4666670392b9e9c4085f"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p03", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 3, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p03.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [1068, 190, 201, 29], "text": "“快看，在那里！", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [1053, 238, 267, 27], "text": "不好，它又跑了！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [187, 605, 420, 29], "text": "小满追追追，看到了许多绿黄瓜。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [66, 651, 677, 29], "text": "“黄米团，用心找。黄瓜是绿色的，番茄是红色的！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 746, 1091, 34], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 色 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 比一比，黄瓜和番茄有什么不同？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "97f2bbe06b59ee3015a2a18017fad432672fe11081ee03cea497cec7bbbbdfbf"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p04", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 4, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p04.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [183, 524, 420, 28], "text": "小满追追追，看到了许多红辣椒。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [62, 571, 677, 29], "text": "“黄米团，用心找。辣椒是尖尖的，番茄是圆圆的！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [165, 617, 471, 29], "text": "“快看，在那里！不好，它又跑了！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [271, 747, 1091, 33], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 追 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 找一找，逃跑的番茄藏在了哪里？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "5b04ca4dd0b61efa79013f60081d064b5e5e2bf8369d52341706748305421c6f"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p05", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 5, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p05.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [43, 71, 440, 28], "text": "小满追追追，看到了许多圆土豆。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [58, 117, 501, 29], "text": "“黄米团，用心找，番茄可能在土里。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [968, 681, 471, 29], "text": "“快看，在那里！不好，它又跑了！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [339, 748, 1023, 32], "text": "汉字源流 楷书 豆 隶书 阅读指导 比一比，土豆和番茄有什么不同？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "882aab8807a9bfcde500a7ff290d6bad3827a96ff674f6bf841aeffdaf87e498"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p06", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 6, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p06.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [61, 71, 440, 28], "text": "小满追追追，看到了许多大南瓜。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [75, 117, 232, 29], "text": "“黄米团，用心找。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [61, 164, 384, 28], "text": "南瓜大大的，番茄小小的。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [966, 620, 501, 28], "text": "“快看，那是什么？它又跑了！快追！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [294, 747, 1061, 32], "text": "汉字源流 楷书 瓜 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 找一找，画面中有哪些小虫子？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "e33ce8bcb7f9fc9667dc47462aa22146b80c643b7e3af74f85e56d0c8445fef8"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p07", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 7, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p07.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [170, 86, 420, 28], "text": "小满追追追，看到了许多长豆角。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [269, 133, 232, 29], "text": "“黄米团，用心找。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [139, 179, 484, 29], "text": "豆角长长像面条，番茄圆圆像面包。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [122, 226, 530, 29], "text": "“圆圆的……圆圆的……在那里！快追！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 746, 1098, 33], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 角 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 读一读，豆角像什么？番茄像什么？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "7d84f413f28e05ae5b8e2b68eb75ab34577c4417b81d1a6bf76d58d8c3d97040"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p08", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 8, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p08.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [1033, 145, 324, 28], "text": "“逃跑的番茄，快出来！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [103, 563, 584, 28], "text": "小满追追追，看到了……红红的、圆圆的番茄。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [225, 609, 354, 27], "text": "“哪个会是逃跑的番茄呢？”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [271, 747, 1091, 32], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 圆 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 指一指，逃跑的番茄藏在了哪里？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "311e31b231063d6fff1cb5c1747cebf92e037c2f1a6e0a49e584d11a4ca4ef0c"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p09", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 9, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p09.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [1232, 412, 246, 29], "text": "黄米团大叫了一声。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [1189, 459, 331, 28], "text": "快看，一个番茄跳了出来！", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [317, 747, 1038, 33], "text": "汉字源流 楷书 叫 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 说一说，画面上发生了什么事？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03"], "sha256": "3e98572771e2fd79c78c9e901de9ac497a9b0bd390b8796b0d2636101d0124c6"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p10", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 10, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p10.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [180, 82, 432, 28], "text": "小小一团满身尖，鼻头翘翘眼睛圆。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [180, 129, 434, 28], "text": "咕噜咕噜滚一滚，宝贝插在身后面。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [1027, 187, 401, 29], "text": "“ ，你也爱吃番茄吗？”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [311, 650, 202, 28], "text": "啊！原来是……", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [271, 748, 1128, 32], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 金文 小篆 隶书 用 楷书 阅读指导 想一想，番茄是怎么跟着小刺猬一起逃跑的？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "a3e7aeee4a89dec3b6aea00ce5f4b84b41142e3cf6e247d9d070abfd277c3536"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p11", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 11, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p11.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [941, 172, 522, 29], "text": "“菜园里面蔬菜多，吃口青菜 ”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [1010, 219, 383, 29], "text": "“我吃绿黄瓜，你吃长豆角。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [1010, 265, 383, 29], "text": "“我吃小番茄，你吃大南瓜。”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [271, 747, 1121, 33], "text": "汉字源流 甲骨文 楷书 南 金文 小篆 隶书 阅读指导 指一指，说一说，大家分别吃了什么蔬菜？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04"], "sha256": "a0ad9a23be46fe8280d400eafd8c43ff27f972bfa944da18ea18e4191e71cab7"}
{"doc_id": "pg_zh02_p12", "book_id": "zh02", "page_no": 12, "image_path": "data/books/zh02/pages/p12.png", "width": 1600, "height": 800, "source_type": "pdf", "text_blocks": [{"block_id": "b01", "bbox": [1082, 83, 214, 29], "text": "小满又来菜园玩。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b02", "bbox": [1050, 129, 275, 28], "text": "黄米团忽然叫了起来。", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b03", "bbox": [1067, 175, 241, 28], "text": "小满高兴地大声说：", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b04", "bbox": [1004, 222, 383, 29], "text": "“快看，有个茄子动起来了！”", "type": "body"}, {"block_id": "b05", "bbox": [317, 746, 1024, 33], "text": "汉字源流 小篆 隶书 菜 楷书 阅读指导 猜一猜，茄子为什么会动？", "type": "note"}], "reading_order": ["b01", "b02", "b03", "b04", "b05"], "sha256": "bb4e38c9dbb159079a300faa852a6ebbec38790439c88f6e19329587584b7ef9"}
